WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.120
I want to continue in volume 2, taking up at August 7, 1899.

2
00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:16.320
This morning my beloved Jesus would not come.

3
00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.920
After much waiting, finally he came.

4
00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:24.980
My confusion and annihilation were such that I was unable to tell him anything.

5
00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:32.800
Jesus said, "The more you annihilate yourself and come to know your nothingness, the more

6
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:39.340
my humanity, unleashing rays of light, will communicate my virtues to you."

7
00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:43.000
This is an extremely important point.

8
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.540
Luke 14, 11 says, "He who humbles himself will be exalted."

9
00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:52.700
The Lord wants us to go beyond humility and to absolute nothingness because that's where

10
00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:58.140
freedom is.

11
00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:04.420
And so he says, "The more you go back into that nothingness and come to know your nothingness,

12
00:01:04.420 --> 00:01:11.740
the more he can release his rays of light and communicate his virtues to us."

13
00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:16.780
So Louisa said, "Lord, I'm so bad and ugly as to be horrifying to myself.

14
00:01:16.780 --> 00:01:19.220
What must I be before you?"

15
00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:22.980
Jesus said, "If you are ugly, I will make you beautiful."

16
00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:29.060
And in the act of saying this, he sent a light from himself to my soul and it seemed that

17
00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:32.220
he would communicate his beauty to it.

18
00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:39.020
And then embracing me, he began to say, "How beautiful you are, but beautiful of my own beauty.

19
00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:45.660
Therefore, what is communicating to her is divine beauty, not human beauty."

20
00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:50.460
Because it's the soul you're talking about and human beauty in the soul wouldn't be any

21
00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:52.020
use.

22
00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:57.220
So this is why I am drawn to love you, he said, "Because my own beauty is in you."

23
00:01:57.220 --> 00:02:04.540
Louisa said, "Who can say how confused I remained more than ever, but may all be for his glory."

24
00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:11.460
August the 8th, 1899 is about resignation, very important.

25
00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:18.180
He continues to make himself seen for just a little and almost angry with people.

26
00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:22.740
As much as I prayed him to pour his bitterness into me, it was impossible.

27
00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:29.500
And without paying attention to what I was saying, he told me, "This is one of the keys

28
00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:32.020
in the divine will.

29
00:02:32.020 --> 00:02:39.940
Resignation absorbs all that can be painful and disgusting to one's nature and renders

30
00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:41.900
it sweet.

31
00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:50.060
So what we want to violently reject will change when we resign ourselves to the cross

32
00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:52.140
and to God's will.

33
00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:58.740
And since my being, Jesus said, "Is peaceful and tranquil in such a way that no matter what

34
00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:05.940
may happen in heaven or on earth, it cannot receive even the slightest breath of disturbance."

35
00:03:05.940 --> 00:03:13.660
Now, here he's coming back to this other key which is terribly important.

36
00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:20.340
The disturbance which blocks everything, he said, "I cannot receive even the slightest

37
00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:22.780
breath of disturbance.

38
00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:30.780
Resignation has the power of grafting these very virtues of mine into the soul.

39
00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:38.540
A resigned soul is always at rest.

40
00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:44.060
And not only herself, but she also allows me to rest peacefully within her.

41
00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:47.660
So I want to give you some scriptures for rest.

42
00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:58.140
Sam 37 verse 7, Sam 55 verse 6, Sam 62 which says over and over again, "Rest in God my

43
00:03:58.140 --> 00:04:09.380
soul," Sam 116 verse 7 and Sam 132 verse 14.

44
00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:16.060
Now August the 10th 1899 is about justice and the fruits of justice.

45
00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:23.980
This morning my sweet Jesus came, he transported me outside of myself and then he disappeared.

46
00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:31.900
As he left me alone I saw as though two candelabra of fire descending from heaven which then

47
00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:38.460
divided into many pieces, formed many lightnings and much hail and came down upon the earth

48
00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:44.340
causing very great torment over plants and people.

49
00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:50.820
The horror and the vehemence of the thunderstorm was such that one could not even pray and people

50
00:04:50.820 --> 00:04:53.860
could not manage to withdraw into their homes.

51
00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:56.700
You can see how frightened I was.

52
00:04:56.700 --> 00:05:05.140
So I began to pray in order to duplicate the Lord and as he came back I saw that he was

53
00:05:05.140 --> 00:05:12.580
carrying an iron rod in his hand, which had a ball of fire at the top.

54
00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:21.220
Well Revelation 12, 5 and 19, 15 and Sam 2 all say that he will rule with a rod of iron.

55
00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:25.340
That means a law that will not change.

56
00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:30.580
And this is what's wrong in our society today, they have changed, they've thrown God's laws

57
00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:35.500
out and they expect all laws to adapt to where they're at.

58
00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:39.820
But that's not what happens, God's law doesn't change.

59
00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:48.260
What God says is eternally.

60
00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:54.260
And then Jesus told me, Louisa said, "My justice has been withheld for a long time and with

61
00:05:54.260 --> 00:06:01.580
reason it wants to take revenge on creatures who have dared to destroy every justice within

62
00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:02.580
themselves.

63
00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:06.620
Ah yes, I find no justice in man.

64
00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:14.300
He has counterfeited himself completely in his words, in his works and in his steps.

65
00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:19.660
Everything is deception, everything is fraud, everything is injustice, which have penetrated

66
00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:25.540
into his heart in such a way that inside and out he's a build of vices.

67
00:06:25.540 --> 00:06:29.960
Poor man, how you have reduced yourself, Jesus said.

68
00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:36.380
So first of all I want to give you Micah 6a, this is what the Lord asks of you, only this

69
00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:41.620
that you would act justly, that you would love tenderly and you would walk humbly with

70
00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:42.620
your God.

71
00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:46.580
That's the summary of all the teaching of the prophets.

72
00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:57.780
I want to give you Revelation 6 verses 1-2 and I want to give you Isaiah 59 verses 1-13.

73
00:06:57.780 --> 00:07:07.700
So notice why justice is coming upon the earth, it's because we are unjust to each other.

74
00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:15.940
If we loved one another, love would come down from heaven and make us all more heavenly

75
00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:17.700
citizens.

76
00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:23.300
But all this injustice and all this deception and all the rest of it absolutely makes hell

77
00:07:23.300 --> 00:07:24.820
on the earth.

78
00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:36.580
Now he is most likely referring to the release of Marxist communism and atheism upon the world.

79
00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:44.140
The French Revolution established atheism in Europe and it's responsible for the terrible

80
00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:48.260
deterioration of the human race.

81
00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:55.620
So injustice and deceit are the work of Satan and justice, truth and simplicity are the marks

82
00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:56.820
of Jesus.

83
00:07:56.820 --> 00:08:02.420
So we will know if we have slipped into a different kingdom.

84
00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:07.020
And saying this, Jesus was swinging the rod he had in his hand in the act of wounding

85
00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:08.340
man.

86
00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:11.500
I said to him, Lord, what are you doing?

87
00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:14.980
And he said, don't fear, do you see this ball of fire?

88
00:08:14.980 --> 00:08:19.900
It will cause fire, but it will only strike the evil.

89
00:08:19.900 --> 00:08:23.140
The good will receive no harm.

90
00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:34.060
Now there I want to give you Revelation 7, 3, Revelation 9, 4, and Revelation 11, 18.

91
00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:40.540
Now in 7, 3 and 9, 4, the good people were marked so that the chastisement wouldn't

92
00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:48.620
come to them and in Revelation 11, 18, the Lord said, I will destroy the destroyers of

93
00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:49.620
the earth.

94
00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:56.180
So that's what he's saying here, that the chastisement will be selective.

95
00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:57.780
It will only strike the evil.

96
00:08:57.780 --> 00:09:00.060
The good will not receive them.

97
00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:04.100
And Louisa responded, our Lord, who's good?

98
00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:05.100
She said.

99
00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:11.380
Now in Mark 10, 18, Jesus said, nobody is good except God alone.

100
00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:13.180
She said, we're all evil.

101
00:09:13.180 --> 00:09:17.300
I beg you not to look at us, but at your infinite mercy.

102
00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:22.980
And in this way you will be placated for everyone.

103
00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:28.700
After this he added, the daughter of justice is truth.

104
00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:36.300
I am eternal truth, that's John 14, 6, I am the way, the truth, and the life.

105
00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:40.660
And I do not deceive, nor can I deceive.

106
00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:47.420
In the same way the soul who possesses justice makes truth shine in all her actions.

107
00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:53.860
Therefore since she knows by experience the true light of truth, if someone wants to deceive

108
00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:59.500
her, since that light which she feels within herself is missing, she immediately recognizes

109
00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:00.860
the deceit.

110
00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:07.980
Now one of the signs of a holy person is that they can see through all the fluff that people

111
00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:14.060
throw up when they're trying to deceive others, and they can touch the truth right at its

112
00:10:14.060 --> 00:10:15.060
center.

113
00:10:15.060 --> 00:10:24.260
A very good example of this is in Acts chapter 4 where Peter and John are on trial for having

114
00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:27.340
cured a cripple.

115
00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:32.060
And they're being ordered not to preach in the name of Jesus.

116
00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:39.620
And Peter was touched by the Holy Spirit and he spoke to the Sanhedrin and he said, listen

117
00:10:39.620 --> 00:10:45.140
you're saying all kinds of things to us, but you've actually put us on trial for healing

118
00:10:45.140 --> 00:10:46.140
a cripple.

119
00:10:46.140 --> 00:10:50.380
He said, is that the state that we've arrived at?

120
00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:58.620
The Sanhedrin were terrified that these men were becoming more and more and more like Jesus.

121
00:10:58.620 --> 00:11:06.220
So if truth is the daughter of justice, then it so happens that with this light of truth

122
00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:15.420
the soul deceives neither herself nor her neighbor, nor can she be deceived, John 832.

123
00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:24.260
The fruit produced by this justice and by this truth is simplicity, which is another quality

124
00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:31.100
of my being, being simple, meaning uncomplicated.

125
00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:34.460
So much so that I penetrate everywhere.

126
00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:38.140
There's nothing that can prevent me from penetrating inside of it.

127
00:11:38.140 --> 00:11:44.820
I penetrate into heaven and into the very abysses, into good and into evil, but my being which

128
00:11:44.820 --> 00:11:52.940
is most simple, just like light is most simple, by penetrating even into evil does not get

129
00:11:52.940 --> 00:12:01.540
dirty, what is more, it doesn't even receive the slightest shadow in the same way through

130
00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:08.980
justice and truth, gathering this beautiful fruit of simplicity within herself, the soul

131
00:12:08.980 --> 00:12:12.060
penetrates into heaven.

132
00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:17.940
She is then able to enter into the hearts and lead them to God and she penetrates into

133
00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:24.820
everything that is good, and if she finds herself with sinners and sees evil, sees the

134
00:12:24.820 --> 00:12:31.500
evil that they do, she does not get dirty because being simple, she immediately brushes

135
00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:35.100
it off without receiving any harm.

136
00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:46.380
Simplicity is so beautiful that my heart is wounded at one gaze of a simple soul.

137
00:12:46.380 --> 00:12:50.900
She is the admiration of angels and of men.

138
00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:54.940
So I want to give you Matthew 18 verses 1 to 3.

139
00:12:54.940 --> 00:13:08.240
I want to give you Sam 116 verse 6 and Sam 119 verse 130.

140
00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:14.100
So now we come to August the 12th, 1899.

141
00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:24.980
Jesus transforms Luisa completely into herself and teaches her charity or divine love.

142
00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:29.380
And that's because God is love, 1 John 4 7.

143
00:13:29.380 --> 00:13:35.140
This morning, after he made me wait for some time, my adorable Jesus came telling me, my

144
00:13:35.140 --> 00:13:42.500
daughter, this morning I want to conform you completely to myself.

145
00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:45.940
I want you to think with my own mind.

146
00:13:45.940 --> 00:13:48.820
I want you to look with my own eyes.

147
00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:54.900
I want you to listen with my own ears, speak with my own tongue, work with my own hands,

148
00:13:54.900 --> 00:13:58.260
walk with my own feet and love with my own heart.

149
00:13:58.260 --> 00:14:03.820
So there's complete identification.

150
00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:09.460
After this, Jesus united his senses mentioned above to mine.

151
00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:14.300
And I saw that he was giving me his own shape.

152
00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:22.220
So there you have your Galatians 2 20, "I no longer live Christ lives in me."

153
00:14:22.220 --> 00:14:28.620
Not only this, but he gave me the grace to make use of it as he did himself.

154
00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:31.140
Now that's the VIP bit.

155
00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:36.740
Not only was she made like him, but she was given the grace and the ability to actually

156
00:14:36.740 --> 00:14:41.740
use it and use it in the same way that Jesus did.

157
00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:46.540
And then he continued, "Great graces, I am pouring into you.

158
00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:53.340
So make sure you keep them all because we've already dealt with messages in which the importance

159
00:14:53.340 --> 00:15:01.180
was in the way we respond to the grace that's given to us."

160
00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:07.780
Eweza said, "I fear very much all my beloved Jesus in knowing myself all full of misery,

161
00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:12.540
that instead of doing good I will make bad use of your graces.

162
00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:19.260
But what I fear the most is my tongue that oftentimes makes me slip in charity towards

163
00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:20.260
my neighbor."

164
00:15:20.260 --> 00:15:25.660
Now, if you go to the book of Proverbs, there are 50 Proverbs on the tongue alone.

165
00:15:25.660 --> 00:15:31.340
And one of them says that there is life and death in the power of the tongue, and those

166
00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:36.220
who use it must eat the fruit thereof.

167
00:15:36.220 --> 00:15:41.580
We murder people with the tongue more often than any other instrument.

168
00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:48.300
Jesus said, "Do not fear, I myself will teach you the way that you must keep speaking with

169
00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:49.300
your neighbor."

170
00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:55.780
Now, James, chapter 4, speaks about the tongue as well.

171
00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:59.460
Matthew 7, verses 1 to 5 also.

172
00:15:59.460 --> 00:16:05.940
Now, these are the lessons that Jesus gave her about speaking about the neighbor.

173
00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:12.580
One, "When you are told something about your neighbor cast a gaze upon yourself and observe

174
00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:16.060
whether you are guilty of the same defect.

175
00:16:16.060 --> 00:16:22.820
Or in that case, wanting to correct is simply wanting to make me indignant and to scandalize

176
00:16:22.820 --> 00:16:23.980
your neighbor."

177
00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:32.060
Second, "If you see yourself free of the defect, rise then and try to speak as I would have.

178
00:16:32.060 --> 00:16:35.620
In this way, you will speak with my own tongue.

179
00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:39.780
By doing so, you will never fail in charity with your neighbor.

180
00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:44.620
On the contrary, with your words, you will do good to yourself and to your neighbor.

181
00:16:44.620 --> 00:16:49.300
And to me, you will give honor and glory.

182
00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:51.900
That takes a lot of wisdom.

183
00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:59.580
We'd have to pray hard for wisdom before you would think of correcting your neighbor."

184
00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:07.340
August 13, 1899, Jesus assumes the image of Louisa.

185
00:17:07.340 --> 00:17:11.860
Jesus continued to make himself seen this morning for just a little, always threatening

186
00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:15.380
to send chastisement.

187
00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:21.180
And as I would go about praying him to placate himself, he would escape me because he obviously

188
00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:25.260
wanted to chastise.

189
00:17:25.260 --> 00:17:28.460
The last time he came, he made himself seen crucified.

190
00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:34.020
I placed myself near him to kiss his most holy wounds, doing various adorations, and

191
00:17:34.020 --> 00:17:40.780
you find examples of this in the hours of the Passion.

192
00:17:40.780 --> 00:17:45.100
So while I was doing this, instead of Jesus Christ, I saw my own image.

193
00:17:45.100 --> 00:17:49.100
I was surprised and I said, "Lord, what am I doing?"

194
00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:51.220
Am I doing the adorations to myself?

195
00:17:51.220 --> 00:17:53.460
This cannot be.

196
00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:59.820
What she was seeing was that we've just been told in the last message that she has been

197
00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:03.700
identified with him.

198
00:18:03.700 --> 00:18:08.180
At that very instant, he changed into the person of Jesus Christ, and he told me, "Don't

199
00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:12.380
be surprised that I have assumed your image.

200
00:18:12.380 --> 00:18:17.900
If I suffer in you continuously, what is the wonder that I have assumed your shape?

201
00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:27.180
Besides, is it not to make you an image of myself that's Romans 8, 29?

202
00:18:27.180 --> 00:18:29.180
That I make you suffer.

203
00:18:29.180 --> 00:18:34.660
In other words, to have complete identification with him as a core redeemer."

204
00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:39.260
Louisa said, "I remained all confused, and Jesus disappeared."

205
00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:48.060
So August the 15th, 1899, so we come back again to this theological virtue of chadity,

206
00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:53.780
or caritas, or agape, and divine love.

207
00:18:53.780 --> 00:18:58.540
This morning my most sweet Jesus came all festive, carrying a bundle of most graceful

208
00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:04.580
flowers in his hands, and placing himself in my heart he would surround his head with

209
00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:09.420
those flowers, and then he would hold them in his hands, enjoying and delighting his

210
00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:11.860
whole self.

211
00:19:11.860 --> 00:19:16.940
While he was celebrating with these flowers, and it seemed he had made a great gain, he

212
00:19:16.940 --> 00:19:25.100
turned to me, and he told me, "My beloved, this morning I have come to place in order

213
00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:28.620
all the virtues of your heart."

214
00:19:28.620 --> 00:19:34.460
Now if you go back to the beginning of your book, this whole journey into the divine

215
00:19:34.460 --> 00:19:39.380
will is the call of the creature to return to the order, the place, and the purpose

216
00:19:39.380 --> 00:19:42.260
for which God had created it.

217
00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:45.900
So here Jesus is coming now to put everything in order.

218
00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:49.740
Now that doesn't mean that Louisa is in disorder.

219
00:19:49.740 --> 00:19:56.620
It means that he's going to put a divine order on it, which is different matter altogether.

220
00:19:56.620 --> 00:20:02.860
The other virtues may remain separate from one another, but chadity, or divine love,

221
00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:06.340
combines and orders everything.

222
00:20:06.340 --> 00:20:12.860
This is like, if you like, connective tissue in the body, it holds all the organs together

223
00:20:12.860 --> 00:20:15.820
and keeps everything in its right place.

224
00:20:15.820 --> 00:20:23.100
So charity is what keeps the soul in all in order, divinely.

225
00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:26.220
